# shield/heater: the Heater shield (P2c ladder slice, LADDER-HEAD; form3, shape2): the heartland's alloy shield from T4.
# A flat top and curved sides to a point; a steel rim (R: brass at T4, gilt at T5), the field lit as a convex face (P:
# etched at T4, filigree at T5), a device chevron over a boss (G: a metal-2 boss at T4, the gem at T5).
# Keys (STYLE_P2 25.5; the kite's layout): rest (hangs still on the off arm), guard (raised to the chest; also the hurt
# hold), block (squared to the threat, a size up, a glint on the rim's top-left: the delight), lie (flat on the ground
# beside the corpse: `anchor pivot`, laid level under the turned body), back (slung for seated and kneeling postures).
# Layers: facing down and left the face is in front; facing up its back (boards, strap, buckle) behind the arm; facing
# right its back behind the body, raised edge-on before the chest (layer neck) for guard and block. Regions (contracts
# 3b): R the rim, P the field round the device, G the boss, N the boards, W wear. Written by the LADDER-HEAD area's
# gen_shields.py from shape masks and checked by eye at 1x and 8x. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (SHIELDS fix round 4, D95: the hero T4) T3-T4 face-on keys carry one bold inverted V from the field's upper corners to its
# centre: 2 px bands (H, device 4, lit edge over J), a field-4 sheen top-left, no boss, P (the etch) cleared round it; T5-T6
# keep theirs (their own views, and the lie and back copies `when shield.t5 replace`).
# (SHIELDS wave-2 fix round 2, judge P3 'the lt4 chevron pale') the field round the chevron sits a step darker (field 3
# only in the lit top-left, field 2 on the lit half, field 1 in the shade half), so the device stands 90-150 luma off it;
# block and bash inset the V one cell from the rims (a 5 x 5 V on the 7-wide field). Shapes, rims and palettes unchanged.
use person
body adult
role shield form3
role shield shape2
layer shield
anchor gripL
keys shield
tags overlay
legend R field 1
legend S field 2
legend T field 3
legend F device 2
legend J device 3
legend H device 4
legend Z field 4
legend k plume 1
legend l plume 2


legend ( plume 0
legend < plume 1
legend > plume 2
legend ^ plume 3
legend ] metal2 4
legend [ metal2 0
legend ; leather 0
legend : leather 1
legend = leather 2
legend + leather 3
legend Q glow 2
legend X glow 3
legend W glow 4
legend U glow 1

